    "interpretation": [
      "SurfaceInfo::CopyNormalTo at 0x02037dcc writes the three-word normal to sp+0x180. The floor case sets bit 4 and loads normal.y from sp+0x184.",
      "The query compares normal.y against +0x100 and calls func_0203794c only when the new Y is greater. That setter stores the input components at +0xfc/+0x100/+0x104.",
      "Reset sets (0, -0x1000, 0). Moving-mesh and Y-scaled moving-mesh queries compare the local and destination Y and copy the same three components.",
      "Actor func_02037318 saves these components while grounded; func_020371fc tests the saved Y before its ground probe."
    ],
    "runtime_validation": "No melonDS session was needed or used: the names follow direct retail instruction dataflow, cross-checked with the matching C++ consumers."
  },
